            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u0026quot;We use Umbraco Cloud for almost all our clients\u2014about 95% of them. The baseline functionality means we can spin up a site pretty quickly and get going fast, which reduces project time and budget while bringing more value to the customers.\u0026quot;\n\nFind out more about Umbraco Cloud here: https://umbraco.com/products/umbraco-cloud/\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mW76ASdqCDs\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
